# Licenses

This repository aggregates public-domain and openly licensed texts.

## Original Chinese text (Hán văn)

Public domain (PD-old). Author traditionally attributed to Laozi; work published millennia ago.

## Vietnamese Wikisource layers
(Hán-Việt romanization + Vietnamese translation on https://vi.wikisource.org/wiki/Đạo_Đức_kinh)

- Original: PD-old
- Translation / editorial layer: Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0)
  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/
- Also dual-licensed as GFDL on the source page

You must retain attribution and share derivatives of the Wikisource translation layer under CC BY-SA 4.0 (or compatible).

